// Page configuration for Indic-Speak.
//
// Ground rule, same as the Indic-Transcribe page: nothing here fabricates
// model output. Every clip under /examples/speak/ was generated by Indic-Speak
// from the script printed beside it (see speakScripts.js), every normalised
// reading is the text normaliser's real output, and the caption timings are
// paced from the clip clock and anchored to measured marks — never invented
// word alignments.
//
// Set VITE_SPEAK_API_URL to let the live demo synthesise text a visitor types.
// Until then the demo plays the pre-generated clip for the sample scripts and
// says plainly that an edited script needs an endpoint.

